I would need some test files with complicated tabular and/or array
material for the current latex tabular and the array.sty extensions.
Is there someone who can provide short tex files for this?

I would need the input file and the log that shows the correct output.
Parts that we don't want to match, e.g. the style release dates, etc.,
should be surrounded in the input file by \typeout{OMIT} and
\typeout{TIMO}. My simple checking system will then remove this part
>from the log before comparison. My system automatically removes the
first line containing `&lplain test' or whatever and the last lines
giving the statistics.  For example

\typeout{OMIT} % this omits the typeout from document styles
\documentstyle[array]{article}
\typeout{TIMO}

.

Please send the stuff directly to me I don't think it is necessary to
use the list for it. And feel yourself asked: if everyone would send
in one test file with checked output then I would get a lot of usable
files which certainly would make further updates to latex safer.

Frank


